  <diagram name="Page-1" id="LijSkkch-WuiCilYJZ2j">
    <mxGraphModel dx="4385" dy="2523" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TD\n    %% Styling Definitions\n    classDef edge fill:#e8f0fe,stroke:#4285f4,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef compute fill:#e6f4ea,stroke:#34a853,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef storage fill:#fef7e0,stroke:#fbbc04,stroke-width:2px;\n    classDef externalAPI fill:#fce8e6,stroke:#ea4335,stroke-width:2px;\n\n    %% 1. System Boundary (External)\n    subgraph ExternalBoundary [\&quot;System Boundary: External\&quot;]\n        Client([\&quot;Mobile / Web Client\&quot;])\n        Internet((\&quot;Public Internet\&quot;))\n    end\n\n    %% 2. Edge &amp; Ingress Layer\n    subgraph EdgeLayer [\&quot;Edge &amp; Ingress Layer\&quot;]\n        CDN[\&quot;Google Cloud CDN&lt;br/&gt;Media Caching\&quot;]:::edge\n        LB[\&quot;Cloud Load Balancing\&quot;]:::edge\n        APIGW[\&quot;API Gateway\&quot;]:::edge\n    end\n\n    %% 3. Asynchronous Processing Pipeline &amp; Storage\n    subgraph AsyncPipeline [\&quot;Asynchronous Processing Pipeline &amp; Storage\&quot;]\n        RawBucket[(\&quot;Cloud Storage&lt;br/&gt;Raw Media Bucket\&quot;)]:::storage\n        Eventarc[\&quot;Eventarc\&quot;]:::compute\n        WorkerJobs[\&quot;Cloud Run&lt;br/&gt;Worker Jobs\&quot;]:::compute\n        VisionAPI[[\&quot;Cloud Vision API&lt;br/&gt;Content Moderation\&quot;]]:::externalAPI\n        FFmpeg[[\&quot;FFmpeg&lt;br/&gt;Video Transcoding\&quot;]]:::externalAPI\n        ProcessedBucket[(\&quot;Cloud Storage&lt;br/&gt;Processed Media Bucket\&quot;)]:::storage\n    end\n\n    %% 4. Core Application &amp; Database\n    subgraph CoreBackend [\&quot;Core Application &amp; Database\&quot;]\n        FeedAPI[\&quot;Cloud Run&lt;br/&gt;Feed API&lt;br/&gt;Social Graph &amp; Timeline\&quot;]:::compute\n        RedisCache[(\&quot;Memorystore Redis&lt;br/&gt;Cache &amp; Distributed Counters\&quot;)]:::storage\n        Firestore[(\&quot;Cloud Firestore&lt;br/&gt;Partitioned NoSQL\&quot;)]:::storage\n        Elasticsearch[(\&quot;Elasticsearch GKE / Cloud Search&lt;br/&gt;Full-text &amp; Hashtag Indexing\&quot;)]:::storage\n    end\n\n    %% 5. Real-Time Interactions\n    subgraph RealTime [\&quot;Real-Time Interactions\&quot;]\n        WSGateway[\&quot;Cloud Run&lt;br/&gt;WebSocket Gateway\&quot;]:::compute\n        RedisPubSub[(\&quot;Memorystore Redis&lt;br/&gt;Pub/Sub Backplane\&quot;)]:::storage\n    end\n\n    %% Ingress Connections\n    Client &lt;--&gt; Internet\n    Internet --&gt; CDN\n    Internet --&gt; LB\n    Internet --&gt; APIGW\n\n    %% Upload Flow\n    Client --&gt;|1. Request Signed URL| APIGW\n    APIGW -.-&gt;|2. Return Signed URL| Client\n    Client --&gt;|3. Direct Upload| RawBucket\n\n    %% Async Pipeline Flow\n    RawBucket --&gt;|OBJECT_FINALIZE Event| Eventarc\n    Eventarc --&gt; WorkerJobs\n    WorkerJobs &lt;--&gt; VisionAPI\n    WorkerJobs &lt;--&gt; FFmpeg\n    WorkerJobs --&gt;|Store Processed Output| ProcessedBucket\n\n    %% Edge Delivery\n    CDN --&gt;|Cached Media Delivery| ProcessedBucket\n\n    %% Database &amp; Feed Connections\n    LB --&gt; FeedAPI\n    FeedAPI &lt;--&gt; RedisCache\n    FeedAPI &lt;--&gt; Firestore\n    Firestore --&gt;|Async Indexing Pull| Elasticsearch\n\n    %% Real-Time Flow\n    Client &lt;--&gt;|WebSocket Connection| WSGateway\n    WSGateway &lt;--&gt;|Distribute Live Notifications| RedisPubSub\n\n    %% Visual Boundaries Styling\n    style ExternalBoundary fill:#f8f9fa,stroke:#ced4da,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5\n    style EdgeLayer fill:#ffffff,stroke:#4285f4,stroke-width:1px\n    style AsyncPipeline fill:#ffffff,stroke:#34a853,stroke-width:1px\n    style CoreBackend fill:#ffffff,stroke:#fbbc04,stroke-width:1px\n    style RealTime fill:#ffffff,stroke:#9334e6,stroke-width:1px&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="pBxexbB_HaKrjlU4z2Y--1">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry height="89" width="332" as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
